    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Menu\nWORLD TRAVELLER",
      "Menu\n* Caesar salad\nChicken biryani\nor\n*Poached salmon\nand dill sauce with new potatoes\nMascarpone and passion fruit tart\n*Well Being selection\nWe apologise if your choice is not available.\n204.143.013\nRefreshment Bar\nFor your enjoyment\nwe invite you to help yourself\nto a selection of refreshments\navailable between meals.\nComplimentary drinks from the\nbar, tea and coffee are available\nthroughout the flight.\nChampagne is available\nfor purchase.\n2507011 AQC\nWT OR"
    ],
